---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageId: home
description: Mobily Enterprises makes Vibe64, an AI coding editor, and Mercbot, a home where people and AI bots live together, and researches how AI agents build software.
---
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__text">
    <p class="overline">Mobily Enterprises · Made in Perth, Western Australia</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title">We build software where people and AI work together.</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">Vibe64 is an AI coding editor. Mercbot is a home where people and AI bots live together. Behind both, we research how AI agents build software, and how that software can stay easy to understand.</p>
    <div class="btn-group" role="group" aria-label="Explore">
      <a class="btn btn--filled btn--m" href="/vibe64/">{% icon "code" %}<span>Explore Vibe64</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--outlined btn--m" href="/mercbot/">{% icon "chat" %}<span>Meet Mercbot</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--outlined btn--m" href="/research/">{% icon "flask" %}<span>Our research</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="stage">
    <span class="stage__shape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <figure class="frame stage__vibe64">
      <div class="frame__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="frame__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="frame__url">vibe64.dev</span></div>
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/assets/products/vibe64-dark.webp" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
        <img src="/assets/products/vibe64-light.webp" width="1440" height="900" alt="The vibe64.dev home page: your own server in the cloud, with an AI coding workspace already set up.">
      </picture>
    </figure>
    <figure class="frame stage__mercbot">
      <div class="frame__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="frame__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="frame__url">mercbot.ai</span></div>
      <img src="/assets/products/mercbot-home.webp" width="1464" height="840" alt="A Mercbot home: a list of bots, each with its latest news, beside a chat with a new bot.">
    </figure>
    <img class="phone stage__phone" src="/assets/products/mercbot-phone.webp" width="480" height="900" alt="Mercbot on a phone: a bot plans the week's dinners and waits for a yes before sending them to the family chat.">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="section__head">
    <p class="overline">What we make</p>
    <h2 class="section__title" id="work-title">Two products, and the research behind them</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="products">
    <article class="card card--product vt-vibe64">
      <div class="card__body">
        <p class="card__overline">AI coding editor</p>
        <h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/vibe64/">Vibe64</a></h3>
        <p class="card__text">Work with AI agents such as Claude Code, Codex and OpenCode in sessions, each with a live Preview, a plan with checklists and a Save to GitHub.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li class="chip">Open-source editor</li><li class="chip">Hosted at vibe64.dev</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card__media">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/assets/products/vibe64-dark.webp" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
          <img src="/assets/products/vibe64-light.webp" width="1440" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy">
        </picture>
      </div>
      <span class="card__go" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow" %}</span>
    </article>
    <article class="card card--product vt-mercbot">
      <div class="card__body">
        <p class="card__overline">People and bots</p>
        <h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/mercbot/">Mercbot</a></h3>
        <p class="card__text">A home where people and AI bots live together: rooms, private chats with a bot, and bots made from templates.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li class="chip">Hosted at mercbot.ai</li><li class="chip">Open-source single-user edition</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card__media"><img src="/assets/products/mercbot-home.webp" width="1464" height="840" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <span class="card__go" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow" %}</span>
    </article>
    <article class="card card--product card--wide vt-research">
      <div class="card__body">
        <p class="card__overline">AI research</p>
        <h3 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/research/">Research</a></h3>
        <p class="card__text">We study how AI agents build software: how reliably they investigate, how source code can become plain language, and how a codebase can become a city you explore.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li class="chip">Agent reliability</li><li class="chip">Program source</li><li class="chip">File City</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card__media"><img src="/assets/products/research-diary.webp" width="1440" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <span class="card__go" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow" %}</span>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

{% if diary.available %}
<section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="diary-title">
  <div class="section__head section__head--row">
    <div>
      <p class="overline">Research diary</p>
      <h2 class="section__title" id="diary-title">Latest from the diary</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--outlined btn--m" href="{{ site.diaryUrl }}">{% icon "diary" %}<span>Read the research diary</span></a>
  </div>
  <ul class="entry-grid">
    {%- for e in diary.entries.slice(0, 3) %}
    {% include "partials/entry-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% endif %}
